I press the 'Submit' button on the screen.
A new page opens.
A one-time code is asked for on the screen.
It is written there that the code is sent via SMS.
A timer starts on my phone.
I wait for the message.
Outside the window, it is raining heavily.
Raindrops are streaking down the glass.
The timer slowly reaches zero.
But no message comes.
I request a new code.
Usually, these servers are very slow at night.
Often, their maintenance is done at this time.
I look towards the screen again.
A whole minute passes.
The second timer also finishes.
The second code also never comes.
I feel a little confused.
I want to finish this task today itself.
